00:54:56.983 --> 00:54:57.816
is it gonna be,

00:54:57.816 --> 00:55:00.036
obviously I think after
the last episode goes up,

00:55:00.036 --> 00:55:03.571
I think next week as of this episode,

00:55:03.571 --> 00:55:04.404
