00:55:21.450 --> 00:55:23.050
And then with a series, right,

00:55:23.050 --> 00:55:23.883
everyone's like, oh,

00:55:23.883 --> 00:55:24.720
I loved the first episode!

00:55:24.720 --> 00:55:26.212
