00:56:49.488 --> 00:56:51.470
- Volcano's generally do that in

00:56:51.470 --> 00:56:53.561
the entire history of the Earth.

00:56:53.561 --> 00:56:55.561
- [Producer] Making it one
of the most devastating

00:56:55.561 --> 00:56:57.457
and deadliest eruptions in human history.

00:56:57.457 --> 00:56:59.275
- Okay.
- 1883.

00:56:59.275 --> 00:57:01.174
- How good of a YouTuber
would you have been

00:57:01.174 --> 00:57:03.454
if your volcano exploded
while you were in the center?

00:57:03.454 --> 00:57:05.010
- It did explode, didn't it?

00:57:05.010 --> 00:57:05.893
After we flew over it--

00:57:05.893 --> 00:57:06.726
- A bit later.

00:57:06.726 --> 00:57:08.420
- Sakurajima is the most
active volcano in Japan.

00:57:08.420 --> 00:57:09.820
It smokes 24 hours a day.

00:57:09.820 --> 00:57:12.310
And then about a week
after we flew over it,

00:57:12.310 --> 00:57:13.277
it actually erupted.

00:57:13.277 --> 00:57:15.463
And if our plane had been going over it,

00:57:15.463 --> 00:57:16.296
it would have been like (spluttering),

00:57:16.296 --> 00:57:17.390
just swatted out the sky.

00:57:17.390 --> 00:57:19.197
- Yeah, it was pretty fucking scary.

00:57:19.197 --> 00:57:20.210
- To be fair, the pilot was quite good.

00:57:20.210 --> 00:57:21.140
He was like a military pilot,

00:57:21.140 --> 00:57:22.240
and that could be a great video.

00:57:22.240 --> 00:57:23.494
Him like (groaning).

00:57:23.494 --> 00:57:24.453
- Just barrel roll.

00:57:24.453 --> 00:57:25.754
(laughs quickly)

00:57:25.754 --> 00:57:27.213
- But yeah, it erupted.

00:57:27.213 --> 00:57:29.176
It was a little bit dangerous.

00:57:29.176 --> 00:57:30.730
- A couple people died, right?

00:57:30.730 --> 00:57:31.780
I'm pretty sure.

00:57:31.780 --> 00:57:32.832
- Not that day, no.

00:57:32.832 --> 00:57:35.647
(Garnt laughing loudly)

00:57:35.647 --> 00:57:36.490
Not then.

00:57:36.490 --> 00:57:37.323
- I'd hope so.

00:57:37.323 --> 00:57:38.820
You just see someone die,

00:57:38.820 --> 00:57:40.040
and it's just like, we still filming this?

00:57:40.040 --> 00:57:40.930
We still going, guys?

00:57:40.930 --> 00:57:42.940
- Isn't the town built
right next to the volcano?

00:57:42.940 --> 00:57:43.773
- Yeah, there's lots,

00:57:43.773 --> 00:57:45.982
a thousand people live round the base.

00:57:45.982 --> 00:57:47.643
- That feels like a bad idea.

00:57:47.643 --> 00:57:48.550
- It's pretty safe.

00:57:48.550 --> 00:57:49.720
The kids have to wear helmets to

00:57:49.720 --> 00:57:51.310
protect them from ash and things.

00:57:51.310 --> 00:57:55.850
- So does an acid bath
and an electric Onsen.

00:57:55.850 --> 00:57:57.340
- There's not much difference between

00:57:57.340 --> 00:58:00.000
