00:58:00.000 --> 00:58:01.580
- It's turning into 100 ways to kill

00:58:01.580 --> 00:58:04.870
yourself with glory
this episode, isn't it?

00:58:04.870 --> 00:58:06.410
Acid baths, active volcanoes--

00:58:06.410 --> 00:58:07.380
- 100 ways to die.

00:58:07.380 --> 00:58:09.122
- [Joey And Connor] 100 ways
to die with Chris Broad.

00:58:09.122 --> 00:58:11.320
- That's the title of this
episode, thank you very much.

00:58:11.320 --> 00:58:15.216
- Do they have a plan for
if the volcano goes off, or?

00:58:15.216 --> 00:58:16.500
- Uh, pray.

00:58:16.500 --> 00:58:17.510
