Japanese mountain alone.

01:51:27.000 --> 01:51:28.230
- Ghost wolves versus--

01:51:28.230 --> 01:51:29.063
- Do you believe in ghosts, Connor?

01:51:29.063 --> 01:51:30.020
- No, not at all.

01:51:30.020 --> 01:51:31.360
- Do you believe in ghost wolves?

01:51:31.360 --> 01:51:33.320
- You seem like someone
superstitious, obviously--

01:51:33.320 --> 01:51:34.260
- No, I don't give a fuck.

01:51:34.260 --> 01:51:35.093
(laughing)

01:51:35.093 --> 01:51:35.926
I don't know any superstitions.

01:51:35.926 --> 01:51:38.200
If ghost exists, we
would have some form of,

01:51:38.200 --> 01:51:39.880
one 10th of some proof.

01:51:39.880 --> 01:51:40.850
- Well, we went into the haunted tunnel,

01:51:40.850 --> 01:51:41.950
and people said that
they could hear a voice,

01:51:41.950 --> 01:51:43.289
