01:51:43.289 --> 01:51:44.690
- Yeah, because people are fucking stupid.

01:51:44.690 --> 01:51:45.630
Of course they fucking want to hear.

01:51:45.630 --> 01:51:46.620
They hear what they want to hear!

01:51:46.620 --> 01:51:48.700
- There's a silhouette of Joey
on the wall in the tunnel.

01:51:48.700 --> 01:51:49.533
- Yeah.
- That was kind of creepy--

01:51:49.533 --> 01:51:50.450
- That was creepy.

01:51:50.450 --> 01:51:51.610
- Do we really think, right,

01:51:51.610 --> 01:51:52.443
yeah, a silhouette,

01:51:52.443 --> 01:51:53.276
could be done by anything there.

01:51:53.276 --> 01:51:54.270
Everything is explainable.

01:51:54.270 --> 01:51:56.370
I think people would just want
there to be something more

01:51:56.370 --> 01:51:58.227
because they take comfort in knowing that,

01:51:58.227 --> 01:51:59.060
you know,

01:51:59.060 --> 01:52:02.410
that something just easily
explains why they're dumb.

01:52:02.410 --> 01:52:03.245
If I don't know something,

01:52:03.245 --> 01:52:04.078
I'm like, I'm just dumb.

01:52:04.078 --> 01:52:04.911
I don't know what it is.

01:52:04.911 --> 01:52:06.080
It's definitely not a ghost.

01:52:06.080 --> 01:52:08.590
Do you think this mystical flying fuck?

01:52:08.590 --> 01:52:10.760
I would have no idea what
it is, why would I know?

01:52:10.760 --> 01:52:12.440
- Mystical flying fuck?

01:52:12.440 --> 01:52:14.433
- Yeah, some shadow or ghost.

01:52:14.433 --> 01:52:15.266
I don't know.

01:52:15.266 --> 01:52:16.390
Do you believe in ghosts, Chris?

01:52:16.390 --> 01:52:17.831
- It's an MFF, a mystical flying fuck.

01:52:17.831 --> 01:52:18.664
- Do you believe in ghosts?

01:52:18.664 --> 01:52:19.497
- Good Lord, no.

01:52:19.497 --> 01:52:21.377
- Did you see the whole, you
tweeted about this I swear.

01:52:21.377 --> 01:52:22.808
The UFO stuff, right?

01:52:22.808 --> 01:52:23.641
- Yeah.

01:52:23.641 --> 01:52:24.574
- Oh, the NASA UFO stuff.

01:52:24.574 --> 01:52:25.482
- Yeah, yeah,

01:52:25.482 --> 01:52:26.315
it's quite interesting.

01:52:26.315 --> 01:52:27.474
- I think it's super fucking cool.

01:52:27.474 --> 01:52:28.971
- There's something there so

01:52:28.971 --> 01:52:31.480
technically advanced we can't get it.

01:52:31.480 --> 01:52:33.070
- I love how people just accepted

01:52:33.070 --> 01:52:34.240
that there's just UFO's now,

01:52:34.240 --> 01:52:36.194
or some nonsense.

01:52:36.194 --> 01:52:37.027
- Some nonsense.

01:52:37.027 --> 01:52:37.860
- The CIA was like, yeah,

01:52:37.860 --> 01:52:40.000
so by the way, UFO's do exist.

01:52:40.000 --> 01:52:42.350
Don't panic, but we just
don't know what it is.

01:52:43.491 --> 01:52:45.779
- That's literally a definition of a UFO.

01:52:45.779 --> 01:52:47.380
- Why is nobody freaking--

01:52:47.380 --> 01:52:50.940
- UFO stands for
unidentified flying object.

01:52:50.940 --> 01:52:52.600
- And they couldn't identify it,

01:52:52.600 --> 01:52:55.860
therefore by definition
it is literally a UFO.

01:52:55.860 --> 01:52:56.693
- For like, what,

01:52:56.693 --> 01:52:57.526
80 years we were like,

01:52:57.526 --> 01:52:59.190
it's a bunch of nonsense,
it's a bunch of hearsay.

01:52:59.190 --> 01:53:00.820
You know, because it would
be one pea or something.

01:53:00.820 --> 01:53:02.456
- Are you talking about UFO's

01:53:02.456 --> 01:53:03.289
or are you talking about aliens,

01:53:03.289 --> 01:53:05.540
'cause there's plenty
of UFO's in the history

01:53:05.540 --> 01:53:07.292
of Earth that have just existed--

01:53:07.292 --> 01:53:09.426
- Yeah, but UFO's that
so weird shit I guess.

01:53:09.426 --> 01:53:10.259
I don't know.

01:53:10.259 --> 01:53:11.092
- That's most UFO's.

01:53:12.000 --> 01:53:13.920
- We don't really have
anything that, like,

01:53:13.920 --> 01:53:16.583
before that was confirmed
to be actually a UFO.

01:53:17.550 --> 01:53:18.383
- How do you know though?

01:53:18.383 --> 01:53:19.900
- Oh, we didn't know until the CIA

01:53:19.900 --> 01:53:21.180
told us that now there is apparently.

01:53:21.180 --> 01:53:22.310
- Well, in the report
it says that there's,

01:53:22.310 --> 01:53:24.685
you know, there's these
vehicles that move.

01:53:24.685 --> 01:53:26.510
- I think in that report,

01:53:26.510 --> 01:53:27.510
NASA was saying that, like,

01:53:27.510 --> 01:53:29.620
yeah, we've known about
this for the past 50 years.

01:53:29.620 --> 01:53:30.453
- The thing is, if you,

01:53:30.453 --> 01:53:31.286
you know, if you--

01:53:31.286 --> 01:53:32.414
- But they kept it a secret.

01:53:32.414 --> 01:53:33.736
- Yeah, they kept it a secret
because they didn't like--

01:53:33.736 --> 01:53:35.410
- Isn't it just weird that
they're suddenly like,

01:53:35.410 --> 01:53:38.015
by the way, when we all
made you look fucking crazy.

01:53:38.015 --> 01:53:39.700
- Well, it kind of seemed
like soft disclosure.

01:53:39.700 --> 01:53:41.050
Like, very gradually roll it out--

01:53:41.050 --> 01:53:42.880
- It's just weird that
nobody spoke about it.

01:53:42.880 --> 01:53:43.760
Nobody was like, oh,

01:53:43.760 --> 01:53:44.593
that's weird, okay.

01:53:44.593 --> 01:53:47.280
- Well, because we're so
limited on the information.

01:53:47.280 --> 01:53:48.290
- How are we supposed to react to it?

01:53:48.290 --> 01:53:51.040
Because it's not the
first time you've probably

01:53:51.040 --> 01:53:54.160
seen some weird fucking
footage of some kind of UFO--

01:53:54.160 --> 01:53:55.536
- Yeah, but it always looks so fake.

01:53:55.536 --> 01:53:56.369
It always looks so fake.

01:53:56.369 --> 01:53:57.930
- I guarantee majority of it is fake.

01:53:57.930 --> 01:53:58.763
- Yeah, 100%.

01:53:58.763 --> 01:53:59.596
All of it's fake.

01:53:59.596 --> 01:54:00.429
- I mean, I would think that the

01:54:00.429 --> 01:54:01.400
majority of it is fake as well,

01:54:01.400 --> 01:54:04.270
but I'm sure there are some
that are on the same level

01:54:04.270 --> 01:54:07.610
as that CIA footage that just were real,

01:54:07.610 --> 01:54:09.660
and no one can explain them.

01:54:09.660 --> 01:54:11.861
Hence the term UFO, right?

01:54:11.861 --> 01:54:13.500
- Yeah, but it's normally
synonymous with aliens though,

01:54:13.500 --> 01:54:14.333
and stuff like that, right?

01:54:14.333 --> 01:54:17.540
So that's what normally tend
to be in the same kind of.

01:54:17.540 --> 01:54:18.820
If someone was like, I'm into UFO's,

01:54:18.820 --> 01:54:20.860
you're like, stay the fuck away.

01:54:20.860 --> 01:54:22.330
You know they're fucking.

01:54:22.330 --> 01:54:23.163
- That's part of the problem, right?

01:54:23.163 --> 01:54:24.250
There's stigma around.

01:54:25.250 --> 01:54:26.460
- People who believe that
shit are normally like--

01:54:26.460 --> 01:54:27.410
- Well, it's the same thing with ghosts,

01:54:27.410 --> 01:54:28.243
right?

01:54:28.243 --> 01:54:29.140
- Yeah.

01:54:29.140 --> 01:54:31.040
I'm sure there's aliens
out there on some planet.

01:54:31.040 --> 01:54:33.250
If we managed to survive and do the weird

01:54:33.250 --> 01:54:34.290
shit that we're doing on Earth,

01:54:34.290 --> 01:54:35.123
I'm sure--

01:54:35.123 --> 01:54:36.560
- I mean, I believe in aliens and stuff,

01:54:36.560 --> 01:54:37.977
but I don't believe in those fucking,

01:54:37.977 --> 01:54:40.760
there's a UFO's crash landed onto Earth,

01:54:40.760 --> 01:54:43.840
and the aliens came in
contact with a farmer.

01:54:43.840 --> 01:54:45.463
- Do you believe in ghosts, Joey?

01:54:45.463 --> 01:54:47.000
- I do, yeah.
- Why?

01:54:47.000 --> 01:54:49.964
- 'Cause I've had paranormal
experience myself.

01:54:49.964 --> 01:54:50.910
- (laughs quickly) Like what?

01:54:50.910 --> 01:54:54.450
- So one of the scariest
ones I had was in Sydney.

01:54:54.450 --> 01:54:57.800
There's this place in Manly
called the Quarantine Center,

01:54:57.800 --> 01:55:00.350
and it was during World War One, I think,

01:55:00.350 --> 01:55:03.810
was the place where all the
soldiers used to stop by

01:55:03.810 --> 01:55:07.060
from overseas to get quarantined
in case they had illnesses,

01:55:07.060 --> 01:55:07.980
and sicknesses, and stuff like that.

01:55:07.980 --> 01:55:11.830
So a lot of people died at
this place naturally, right?

01:55:11.830 --> 01:55:13.840
And they have these night time tours

01:55:13.840 --> 01:55:15.180
for this place that you can go,

01:55:15.180 --> 01:55:17.260
you can go to the hospitals and all,

01:55:17.260 --> 01:55:19.553
it's very creepy stuff, right?

01:55:19.553 --> 01:55:22.060
So I went with my sister
once for her birthday,

01:55:22.060 --> 01:55:22.893
I think it was,

01:55:22.893 --> 01:55:24.780
and my sister has this weird,

01:55:24.780 --> 01:55:27.720
I guess you'd call it
sixth sense, if you will?

01:55:27.720 --> 01:55:29.800
You know, take that how you will.

01:55:29.800 --> 01:55:30.633
Take that how you will--

01:55:30.633 --> 01:55:32.770
- Pretty sure Chris is
quivering in jealousy.

01:55:32.770 --> 01:55:33.603
- Take that how you will,

01:55:33.603 --> 01:55:36.563
but she has that, whatever that is.

01:55:37.420 --> 01:55:40.510
And there was this one moment where

01:55:40.510 --> 01:55:41.670
we were inside the hospital,

01:55:41.670 --> 01:55:42.803
and I don't have anything like that.

01:55:42.803 --> 01:55:44.950
I don't pretend to feel like, oh,

01:55:44.950 --> 01:55:46.590
I feel a ghost present
or anything like that.

01:55:46.590 --> 01:55:48.230
I just find it fascinating.

01:55:48.230 --> 01:55:50.750
But then we went into this particular,

01:55:50.750 --> 01:55:52.560
I think it was a nurse room.

01:55:52.560 --> 01:55:54.190
And my sister just stopped and just

01:55:54.190 --> 01:55:56.410
immediately started breaking down crying.

01:55:56.410 --> 01:55:57.602
And I was like, what's wrong?

01:55:57.602 --> 01:55:59.200
It's just a dark room?

01:55:59.200 --> 01:56:01.010
You've been through this entire hospital,

01:56:01.010 --> 01:56:02.870
and it's this room where she
just suddenly breaks down.

01:56:02.870 --> 01:56:03.823
She's like, I can't.

01:56:03.823 --> 01:56:06.390
I can't move past this point.

01:56:06.390 --> 01:56:07.900
And she just couldn't explain it.

01:56:07.900 --> 01:56:11.140
She just felt something in
this one particular room.

01:56:11.140 --> 01:56:13.960
And then later we found
out that was the place

01:56:13.960 --> 01:56:17.110
where they would
euthanize all the soldiers

01:56:17.110 --> 01:56:19.483
that couldn't survive
whatever illness it was.

01:56:19.483 --> 01:56:22.940
So that's where all the
soldiers basically died.

01:56:22.940 --> 01:56:24.130
And I was like,

01:56:24.130 --> 01:56:25.190
okay, look.

01:56:25.190 --> 01:56:27.190
You can believe in sixth sense

01:56:27.190 --> 01:56:28.287
and all that kind of shit all you want,

01:56:28.287 --> 01:56:31.170
but you have to admit that's
pretty fucking terrifying,

01:56:31.170 --> 01:56:33.611
especially when you're there in person.

01:56:33.611 --> 01:56:36.490
- You know, I don't really
believe any of that.

01:56:36.490 --> 01:56:38.230
I would be like that's just coincidence.

01:56:38.230 --> 01:56:39.120
- Well, I used to work
at a haunted castle,

01:56:39.120 --> 01:56:41.490
and my colleagues always
said they saw ghosts.

01:56:41.490 --> 01:56:43.280
- No they fucking didn't.
- But I'd be like,

01:56:43.280 --> 01:56:44.452
if someone opened a window,

01:56:44.452 --> 01:56:45.285
they'd be like, it's a ghostly presence.

01:56:45.285 --> 01:56:46.118
I'd be like, no,

01:56:46.118 --> 01:56:47.484
it's a window open.

01:56:47.484 --> 01:56:49.430
- It's just a draft, isn't it?

01:56:49.430 --> 01:56:50.890
- When we expect something to be there,

01:56:50.890 --> 01:56:51.723
we, you know,

01:56:51.723 --> 01:56:53.070
our mind is the biggest fucking

01:56:53.070 --> 01:56:54.468
joke that has ever been played.

01:56:54.468 --> 01:56:56.514
Our mind tricks us in so many ways.

01:56:56.514 --> 01:56:57.347
- Oh, of course.

01:56:57.347 --> 01:56:58.830
I'm sure there's moments where it's like,

01:56:58.830 --> 01:57:00.130
you know, you just psych yourself out.

01:57:00.130 --> 01:57:00.963
Right?

01:57:00.963 --> 01:57:02.043
And you just think you've seen something

01:57:02.043 --> 01:57:04.968
because you're already in that mindset.

01:57:04.968 --> 01:57:06.330
But there are some
instances where I'm like,

01:57:06.330 --> 01:57:08.080
oh, that's actually kind of creepy.

01:57:08.080 --> 01:57:09.629
Like I don't know if it's a ghost,

01:57:09.629 --> 01:57:10.520
I don't know if it's sixth sense,

01:57:10.520 --> 01:57:11.353
but it's something.

01:57:11.353 --> 01:57:12.186
- Yeah, I mean,

01:57:12.186 --> 01:57:14.033
I think there is something there.

01:57:14.940 --> 01:57:15.980
There are too many things,

01:57:15.980 --> 01:57:18.008
I feel, that can't be explained.

01:57:18.008 --> 01:57:19.237
Like the UFO, for example--

01:57:19.237 --> 01:57:20.910
- You don't go to an
entire hospital and then

01:57:20.910 --> 01:57:22.646
immediately start
breaking down in a room--

01:57:22.646 --> 01:57:25.250
- But I might if I was in a
hospital known for trauma.

01:57:25.250 --> 01:57:27.140
- You could do that if your
head space is there, right?

01:57:27.140 --> 01:57:27.973
- She might have seen so much--

01:57:27.973 --> 01:57:30.110
- But she was fine throughout
the entire hospital,

01:57:30.110 --> 01:57:31.305
except for this one room.

01:57:31.305 --> 01:57:32.540
- It might have been building up, but.

01:57:32.540 --> 01:57:33.373
- Maybe?

01:57:34.647 --> 01:57:37.709
- It's like when people
give, people don't,

01:57:37.709 --> 01:57:39.920
the mind is a really fucking weird

01:57:39.920 --> 01:57:41.040
thing that we don't understand.

01:57:41.040 --> 01:57:43.804
You know, people give witness
testimony at trials and stuff.

01:57:43.804 --> 01:57:47.040
They 100% swear they saw
stuff that they didn't see.

01:57:47.040 --> 01:57:47.873
Right?

01:57:47.873 --> 01:57:48.820
So it's like, I don't know.

01:57:48.820 --> 01:57:51.860
I find that we like to be able
to easily explain everything,

01:57:51.860 --> 01:57:53.190
even when we have no explanations.

01:57:53.190 --> 01:57:54.060
Like we don't have an explanation,

01:57:54.060 --> 01:57:54.893
we're like, oh,

01:57:54.893 --> 01:57:55.726
it's ghosts or some shit.

01:57:55.726 --> 01:57:57.229
I'm like, that's just
another way for you to cope,

01:57:57.229 --> 01:57:58.480
because you want an explanation.

01:57:58.480 --> 01:57:59.313
You know?

01:57:59.313 --> 01:58:00.146
But maybe you just don't know.

01:58:00.146 --> 01:58:00.979
Maybe you don't have the capacity

01:58:00.979 --> 01:58:02.260
to know what that noise or--

01:58:02.260 --> 01:58:05.520
- I find it fascinating
that we don't know, right?

01:58:05.520 --> 01:58:06.700
And that there is mystery behind them

01:58:06.700 --> 01:58:07.903
that no one has really figured out.

01:58:07.903 --> 01:58:10.290
Is it just in your head or
is there something there.

01:58:10.290 --> 01:58:12.663
- We're pretty fucking
stupid people in general.

01:58:12.663 --> 01:58:13.580
- I don't know about that, mate.

01:58:13.580 --> 01:58:14.777
Speak for yourself, mate.

01:58:14.777 --> 01:58:15.901
Speak for yourself, Connor.

01:58:15.901 --> 01:58:16.734
- Very flawed.

01:58:16.734 --> 01:58:17.570
Humans are very flawed, right?

01:58:17.570 --> 01:58:19.400
- Speak for yourself, Connor.

01:58:19.400 --> 01:58:21.057
- Fuck off, Chris.

01:58:21.057 --> 01:58:22.791
(all laughing quickly)

01:58:22.791 --> 01:58:25.600
He climbed Mount Fuji
in a T-shirt and shorts.

01:58:25.600 --> 01:58:26.710
- And I came back alive.

01:58:26.710 --> 01:58:27.710
- We're flawed, right?

01:58:27.710 --> 01:58:29.500
And for some reason we like to think

01:58:29.500 --> 01:58:32.173
that we can think of every
single answer to everything

01:58:32.173 --> 01:58:34.180
when we most certainly can fucking not.

01:58:34.180 --> 01:58:35.510
I mean, for how many fucking years

01:58:35.510 --> 01:58:37.500
we were just fighting
with sticks and stones.

01:58:37.500 --> 01:58:38.613
- Why aren't we Twitter verified?

01:58:38.613 --> 01:58:40.514
(all laughing quickly)

01:58:40.514 --> 01:58:43.023
(loud overlapped talking)

01:58:43.023 --> 01:58:43.856
- UFO's, ghosts,

01:58:43.856 --> 01:58:45.548
that is top of my list.

01:58:45.548 --> 01:58:46.381
Unsolved mysteries.

01:58:46.381 --> 01:58:48.130
- No, I'm completely okay with people,

01:58:48.130 --> 01:58:48.963
like, you know,

01:58:48.963 --> 01:58:50.533
believing, not believing in it--

01:58:50.533 --> 01:58:51.703
- If someone says they believe in ghosts,

01:58:51.703 --> 01:58:52.536
I won't shred them apart.

01:58:52.536 --> 01:58:53.480
- I don't force it,

01:58:53.480 --> 01:58:54.950
but sometimes if people
explain shit to me,

01:58:54.950 --> 01:58:56.131
that I'm like, that's terrible and shit.

01:58:56.131 --> 01:58:57.137
- I can tell, like,

01:58:57.137 --> 01:58:59.750
there are a lot of these
kinds of like mystical,

01:58:59.750 --> 01:59:00.583
mythical things,

01:59:00.583 --> 01:59:03.110
where it's like that's kind
of too dumb to believe--

01:59:03.110 --> 01:59:06.400
- I feel like what's really
muddied the water is just how,

01:59:06.400 --> 01:59:09.143
you know, some people have
obviously monetized this.

01:59:09.143 --> 01:59:13.250
You see these ghost reality TV shows,

01:59:13.250 --> 01:59:14.083
and I'm just like,

01:59:14.083 --> 01:59:15.730
this is just sensationalized--

01:59:15.730 --> 01:59:17.520
- Haunted investigators
and stuff like that.

01:59:17.520 --> 01:59:20.430
- How are you supposed to
take this seriously anymore?

01:59:20.430 --> 01:59:24.130
I've heard genuinely things
that just can't be explained.

